### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Swagger document
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger.json

### OAuth status
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/status

### Begin OAuth login (open this URL in a browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/github

### Users: get all
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Users: get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### Events: get all
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### Events: get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}

### Venues: get all
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues

### Venues: get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues/{{venueId}}

### Venues: create (OAuth session required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Student Center Room 201",
  "venueType": "in-person",
  "building": "Student Center",
  "room": "201",
  "address": "Campus Central",
  "capacity": 80,
  "accessibilityNotes": "Elevator access available."
}

### Registrations: get all
GET {{baseUrl}}/registrations

### Registrations: get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/registrations/{{registrationId}}

### Registrations: create (OAuth session required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "eventId": "{{eventId}}",
  "status": "registered",
  "notes": "Requires wheelchair seating."
}

### Registrations: update (OAuth session required)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/registrations/{{registrationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "attended"
}

### Registrations: delete (OAuth session required)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/registrations/{{registrationId}}

### OAuth logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
